// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P1845842417" "Tome of Hequat Stolen!"
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P47176636" "Crown of Enos Taken From Aeon Museum of Antiquities!"
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P2998946380" "Vigilantes from Paragon Invade Rogue Isles!"
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P3354078750" "Blackbeard's Tooth Purchased by Mysterious Buyer"
