"P990065319" "Event Horizon Said To Foretell Future!"
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P4092276631" "The Painter Found Murdered!"
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P1761311435" "Cap Au Diable Museum Plundered!"
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P3410123197" "Black Market in Henri Relics Thriving"
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P1349325848" "Break In At Otto's Occult Shop"
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P4057502232" "Library Robbed, Rare Books Missing"
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P1402433390" "Reward Offered by the Void"
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P1737853050" "{VillainGroup} Flee Wrath of Croatoans"
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P2701119102" "Enigmatic Killed in Rogue Isles; Teleporter Malfunctioned"
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P1172949571" "Aether Slain in Fight With {VillainGroup}!"
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P592451451" "Weird Sounds Heard in City"
