// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Item Var Name - ITEM_DESCRIPTION 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2456887851" "The old leatherbound book contains numerous spells and incantations, but none that seem to serve your nefarious purpose."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2833420126" "The old crown hums with arcane energy. You put it on your head and--nothing. Ah well. It's the black market for this trinket."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3235794416" "This tiny sliver of crystal must be it. You can feel it pulsing with eldritch energy."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P834624430" "The chest belonged to one of Blackbeard's mistresses long ago. Inside were personal letters, old rags, and as promised, Blackbeard's gold tooth."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2251884443" "This is the crucifix of the famous Father Martin Henri, who is said to have led the purge against the Children of Enos, and defeated the legendary demon of Cap au Diable."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P323190515" "L'Ollonais was one of the cruelest pirates ever to sail these waters. He once cut the heart out of one prisoner and forced another to eat it. Perhaps with this very blade."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1879415040" "The story goes that a girl named Maria was the last of the Children of Enos taken from the islands by the French. Supposedly, her tears fell to the ground on Cap au Diable and turned to diamonds. If that was true you'd be making a lot more little girls cry."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2015630606" "The Blue Oyster was once used by the Children of Enos to summon some dark sea god from the depths. Doesn't look like it's got much mojo now. Or maybe you just don't know the right mumbo jumbo."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1101083291" "The Sea Lute is an actual instrument, though it looks as if it were carved from coral. You play it, but hear only low, mournful sounds--like that of dying whales. The music gives you a creepy feeling. Like you just stepped in dead fish."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P928296497" "It looks like a gold-plaited turtle shell to you. It's artistic value is dubious, but gold is gold."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P639857976" "There's no way this map is real. The islands it refers to don't even exist. Ah well. Maybe your broker can still sell it to some newb for the price of dinner at least."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1456553822" "Nice! Lavigne has Captain Mako on speed dial! You give the mutant a ring and hear a raspy voice say 'Whattya want, Charlie? Hello? Charlie? This ain't Charlie! Whoever dis is is in big trouble! I'll kill ya! I'll worse than kill ya! I'll rend you limb from limb you squid-loving piece of--' You wisely hang up before Mako somehow finds out who you are."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P529966848" "It's said this man-shaped root screams when torn from the earth. Fortunately, this one's already been yanked for you."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2365902827" "This is disgusting. It looks like some kind of naked pygmy with blue skin and green hair and eyes and smells like rotten eggs."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1923621179" "Doubloons, ingots, and pieces o' eight. It doesn't get any better than this."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1481771890" "It's an odd crystal with a thin violet line running through the middle. You have no idea how to read it, but there's a large 'spike', like on a heart monitor, a few millimeters to the right. Does that mean some major event is coming soon?"
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P4162253241" "The painting is much smaller than you imagined. And not very good. Whatever juice the Painter had must be his--not the painting's."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1689877454" "Hmm. Just some old rusty blades. Maybe these were pirate weapons or something. The Rogue Isles were full of them a few centuries back."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P32977599" "There's no way these are actually Henri's bones. You're not even sure if they're human. Still, a buck's a buck and some wide-eyed relic-hunter probably won't know the difference."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1997833747" "Hmm. Weird bits of animals, old pages you can't read, and is that a tongue? Great. At least your fence will know what to do with it."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2715557703" "Hmm. Some weird stuff. A manuscript by Crowley, the 'Chaos Cook Book', 'How to Serve Man.' Neat stuff."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P372227487" "Eye of newt. Wing of bat. Yeah, this'll be worth a fortune. Not. You could have found better junk in the trash."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2620306333" "Hmm. Tiny little bones on a leather strap, some bat's wings, and bottle of frogs. Nice. Must have some purpose, but you're not sure what. Somebody somewhere will buy 'em though. They always do."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1457481974" "Yuk. Gruesome. The things you'll do for a few bucks."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P4080088718" "Aether looks quite the worse for wear. Especially after you rip out a lock of the flowing white hair he was so proud of."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P1717072291" "It's some sort of sonic projector. If hooked to an amplifier of some sort, it could devastate several blocks. It doesn't look stable though, so it's best to just sell it to someone a little higher up on the food chain."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P4241864746" "A handful of blue stones with what look like little eyes inside. Creepy."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2667223" "Hmm. It's red and it's a ruby and it makes you feel weak when you hold it. Best to send this sucker to a cape and see what happens. Or maybe sell it to one of the Rogue Isle's major players. They'd probably pay big money for something like this."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3384677899" "It's a painting of Lee Towers in Paragon City. You don't know how to use the painting to get there, and it's not a particularly good piece. You wonder why these losers wanted it so bad."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2546312799" "Yup. About what you figured. If Isis used this staff it was to hobble around in her old age."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P995497863" "This nasty claw was locked up tight. Looks like it came from a demon or something. You shake it a few times but none of the locals drop dead. How disappointing."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2340426112" "Wow. That is one big claw. You'd hate to imagine the bird this sucker came from."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P543993755" "Urns, pots, and a couple of bronze weapons. You don't sense mystical mojo on anything, so it's best to just sell them off before the original owner follows the trail to you."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P715348873" "The blade feels heavy in your hand. Visions of demons and ancient ziggurats dance in your mind. You feel a dark and malevolent presence creeping into your mind. You put the dagger to your own throat and--WHOA! Perhaps this relic is too powerful for you just yet. Best just to sell it to some chump and let him deal with its insanity."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2086325755" "There's some nice stuff here. Urns with ancient pictures, a spearhead, and even some diamond-studded toga clasps."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P3845293304" "It's a statue of a Tisiphone, one of the ancient furies of Greek legend. The legends say they were placed on earth to torment evil-doers. Maybe there was something to the Fortunata's vision after all. But what could it mean? You phone this one in and let Arachnos come get it. Best not to touch something like this."
// Script Variable ITEM_DESCRIPTION :
"P2152483542" "Hah! The urn is cracked. There isn't a drop of mumbo-jumbo-juice left."
// Script Variable INTERACT_ACTION_STRING :
"P1469950025" "Searching..."
// Script Variable AMBUSH_ATTACK_STRING :
"P2523319180" "Get {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable AMBUSH_ATTACK_STRING :
"P862497936" "You'll pay for violating our sanctum, {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable AMBUSH_ATTACK_STRING :
"P2039133918" "There's {VillainName}! Get 'em!"
// Script Variable AMBUSH_ATTACK_STRING :
"P147683879" "Attack! No prisoners!"
// Script Variable AMBUSH_ATTACK_STRING :
"P1552257187" "{VillainName}! Make the intruder pay!"
// Script Variable AMBUSH_ATTACK_STRING :
"P137058483" "You? Big mistake."
// Script Variable AMBUSH_ATTACK_STRING :
"P3784408854" "This was your LAST mistake, {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable RETURNED_STRING :
"P2602469266" "ReturnString"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P5974919" "I hear {VillainName} stole  {ITEM_NAME}!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P782625694" "Last I heard, {VillainName} had {ITEM_NAME}."
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P2707524139" "WSPDR had a story about {VillainName} stealing {ITEM_NAME} right out from under the {VillainGroup}'s noses."
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P1005151371" "WSPDR said {VillainName} stole {ITEM_NAME}."
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P1618758224" "Wow! {VillainName}! The thief who stole {ITEM_NAME}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3762774050" "I hear someone's been spreading rumors about our find."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1921025984" "Guard {ITEM_NAME} well. Few can unlock its powers, and I prefer to keep it that way."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P577706820" "Sometimes, I swear I hear {ITEM_NAME} whispering to me."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2779130535" "Our informants say {VillainName} is on the way to steal {ITEM_NAME}. This must not be allowed."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3054412521" "Double the guards. We must protect {ITEM_NAME}."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2185834031" "Where did you find {ITEM_NAME}? Hmm. How fortunate."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3583406007" "Imagine. Such a find. Right under our very noses."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1980400286" "When we're finished, destroy {ITEM_Name}. I don't want anyone else to have it."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2989356918" "Protect {ITEM_NAME}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3350725194" "Kill {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P528966528" "NO! You will not have {ITEM_NAME}. It's mine, mine, mine!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3320594388" "Keep your filthy hands off {ITEM_NAME}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P289378890" "You will regret the day you crossed {VillainGroup}, {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3125385178" "How did you find us? No matter. Kill {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P738746912" "Oh no no no. Quick! Take {ITEM_NAME} and run! It's {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2162595999" "{VillainName}! Arrrgggh!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3810944676" "{VillainName}. We've been expecting you. Welcome to our TRAP!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P296597020" "{VillainName}? Muh ha hah. This will be a treat."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2558441653" "{VillainName}. I should have known it was you on our tail. No matter. This ends now!"
// Script Variable ACCEPT_STRING :
"P417990872" "Steal {ITEM_NAME} from the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1473698528" "The trip to get here probably lasted longer than the {VillainGroup} will."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P367694999" "This is what being a villain is all about. Taking what you want, when you want. Now get in there and show the {VillainGroup} who runs this place."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P3524603294" "You get that familiar feeling in your stomach. You're not nervous-you're excited you're about to bust some heads."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2468493225" "You hear voices ahead. Time to smash."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1371086680" "This is definitely the place. Prepare for some carnage followed by fat loot."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2387005675" "You're here. The {VillainGroup} are about to have a very bad day."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1998519206" "The little voices in your head tell you to smash the {VillainGroup} and take their stuff."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P3600407302" "It's a simple task. Beat the {VillainGroup} into a little greasy spot. Take {ITEM_NAME}. Go to your favorite club and enjoy the loot."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P36715500" "It's quiet. Too quiet."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P572471620" "No one at the door. Odd. This could be a trap."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2955165475" "This place smells like {VillainGroup}. You hate the smell of {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P943423119" "Knock, knock. Anybody home? There won't be soon."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P569241241" "Heeere's {VillainName}. Time to play."

